              "id": "P71447"
            }
          ],
          "value": "The catalysis proceeds via a phosphoenzyme formed by reaction of an active-site nucleophile with the cofactor glucose 1,6-diphosphate (G1,6-diP). The phosphorylated mutase binds either G1P or G6P and transfers the phosphoryl group to the C(6)OH or C(1)OH, respectively"
